**Dwarves** (/' *dwɔɹfs* /) are one of the common races of [[iagoband|Iagoband]]. They are known for their martial ability, short statures and mountain cities.

# Appearance
Dwarves are similar to humans, although they are much shorter. Their height runs between 1,2m and 1,5m, yet they weigh as much as humans. Their obvious distinction from other races ar either long groomed beards. Their skin tones are human-like, but the Duergar are the exception here, with their gray skin.

# Powers and Abilities 
## Dwarven Fortitude
The Dwarven race has a long history of great heroes and legends. This has given the Dwarven society a rough and tough shape, making most of the Dwarves stronger and nimbler.

# Subraces
## Mountain Dwarf
Mountain Dwarves, not unlike Duergar, tend to avoid High society. Living in smaller civilization they have become very adept in smiting. 

## Hill Dwarf
Hill Dwarves are the ones who live in in High society. They've grown to be the wisest among their kin. They lack the traditional toughness and avid armor.
 
## Duergar
The Duergar (/ˈ *dwɛɹɡɑɹ* /) live underground in their grand Mountain Cities. Their eyes, skin and hearing have adjusted to the lack of sun. They can see underground very well, but their iris's can't adjust to the sunlight outside. The lack of sun underground turned their skin grey. Their hearing filters out the huge bouncing echoes underground.
